<h1>FIRST Robotics Team Management Software</h1>

<%= render "definition" %>

<p class="lead">GatherPack started as a <a href="https://westside-robotics.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FIRST Robotics</a> mentor’s fix for scattered spreadsheets and sticky notes — attendance, fundraising, and competition logistics in one place. Today it runs teams through build season and competition without a tangle of disconnected apps.</p>

<img src="/images/ss-directory.png" alt="GatherPack robotics team roster with students, parents, mentors, and badge tracking" width="826" height="826" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" class="rounded border">

<section id="why-first" class="card" aria-labelledby="why-first-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="why-first-heading">Why FIRST teams choose GatherPack</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>A FIRST program juggles more than robots — parents, mentors, subteams, shop time, travel, dues, and fundraisers. GatherPack was born when one volunteer developer built a small internal tool to pull that together in 2014. Over ten years it became the operational backbone of an organization that has since quadrupled in size. When the original tool showed its age, the same developer and a few students rebuilt it as GatherPack — now flexible enough for FRC, FTC, and the community groups that surround a team.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">You keep ownership of the tool: self-host free under the <a href="https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MIT license</a> or let <a href="https://sledgehammerinfosystems.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sledgehammer Infosystems</a> handle hosting at a significantly discounted rate for FIRST teams. <a href="/open-source/">Compare options</a> · <a href="/hosting/">See hosting tiers</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

