<section id="communication-fit" class="card" aria-labelledby="communication-fit-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="communication-fit-heading">Keep families in the loop</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Announcements scoped to teams (drive crew vs. outreach vs. all-hands) with scheduled publishing and automatic expiration. Weekly email summaries mean families actually see the update instead of missing it in chat scroll. Multi-channel text/Slack/Discord are <a href="/roadmap/">on the roadmap</a> with explicit timing. <a href="/features/communication/">How communication works →</a></p>
