<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">FIRST team FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Can we self-host to keep costs down?</h3>
    <p>Yes — GatherPack is MIT-licensed. Self-host at no cost with full source access, or choose managed hosting at a significantly discounted FIRST rate. <a href="/open-source/">Self-host details</a> · <a href="/hosting/">Hosting tiers</a></p>
    <h3 class="h5">Does it handle time-tracking for shop hours?</h3>
    <p>Yes. The kiosk handles PIN/barcode/RFID check-in, multiple time-clock periods, and bulk clock-out. Reports roll up by period for service hours and attendance. <a href="/features/events/">Event &amp; time tracking →</a></p>
    <h3 class="h5">How is GatherPack different from TeamConvene?</h3>
    <p>GatherPack is open source and self-hostable; TeamConvene is SaaS-only. If you want data ownership, cost control, and the ability to extend via <a href="/features/automation/">reports, actions, and hooks</a>, that’s the meaningful trade. More in <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>.</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="/faq/">All FAQs →</a> · <a href="/features/">Browse all features</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

